<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-zhoushu" book-id="b-zhoushu-048" chapter-id="c-zhoushu-048-shenwuhua-shen" source-id="s-zhoushu-048-shenwuhua-shen-ws2432546">
  <p id="c-zhoushu-048-shenwuhua-shen:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-zhoushu-048-shenwuhua-shen:p001:m0000" ref="9wm_vgh_vz1_AE">沈君游</persName>，吳興人。祖<persName id="c-zhoushu-048-shenwuhua-shen:p001:m0009" ref="9wm_vgh_vz1">僧畟</persName>，左民尚書。父<persName id="c-zhoushu-048-shenwuhua-shen:p001:m0018" ref="9wm_vgh_vz1_A">巡</persName>，東陽太守。</p>
  <p id="c-zhoushu-048-shenwuhua-shen:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">弟<persName id="c-zhoushu-048-shenwuhua-shen:p002:m0001" ref="9wm_vgh_vz1_AF">君公</persName>，有幹局，美風儀，文章典正，特為巋所重。歷中書黃門侍郎、御史中丞。自都官尚書為義興王<persName id="c-zhoushu-048-shenwuhua-shen:p002:m0045" ref="0va_s3x_wb4_BAA">瓛</persName>師。從<persName id="c-zhoushu-048-shenwuhua-shen:p002:m0049" ref="0va_s3x_wb4_BAA">瓛</persName>奔陳，授侍中、太子詹事。隋平陳，以<persName id="c-zhoushu-048-shenwuhua-shen:p002:m0067" ref="0va_s3x_wb4_BAA">瓛</persName>同謀度江，伏誅。</p>
</text>
